+&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _RUN-TIME-ATTRIBUTES
+/* SETTINGS FOR DIALOG-BOX d-out-prt
+   FRAME-NAME                                                           */
+ASSIGN
+       FRAME d-out-prt:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE.
